      "message": "fix(post): the Q208 guard compares the ask with a fixed old-cycle feed\n\nThe q379-level guard compared the asked Q208 with RETRACT_FEED_MAX\nitself. A change of that constant changed the two sides, so an ask\nthat the 340 49x cycle 205 cannot take was dropped, not refused. The\nguard now compares with OLD_CYCLE_RETRACT_FEED (99999.999). The test\nasserts that its script variant changes the asked feed.\n\nRefs #4094\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
